# OPTIONAL overrides for the Stripe price IDs.
#
# In this project the live copy is .env.kid-sequencer (named for the project ID,
# committed, and loaded automatically at deploy) — that is where the price IDs
# that actually ship live, and it already overrides the defaults in index.js.
# So for Kid Sequencer you normally edit THAT file, not this one; this template
# is for a fresh checkout or a second project.
#
# Precedence at deploy time: environment > .env.<projectId> > index.js default.
# `npm run check:stripe` resolves them the same way and tells you which tier a
# given ID came from.
#
# Real SECRETS (STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET, ENGINE_TOKEN) are
# NEVER kept here — set them with: firebase functions:secrets:set <NAME>

# STRIPE_PRICE_ID=price_xxx          # Pro £4.99/mo
# TOPUP_AI10_PRICE=price_xxx
# TOPUP_AI25_PRICE=price_xxx
# TOPUP_AI50_PRICE=price_xxx
# TOPUP_SLOTS20_PRICE=price_xxx
# TOPUP_SLOTS50_PRICE=price_xxx
